WEBVTT

00:01:57.321 --> 00:02:02.535
He chose to follow the path of the brother
who was 16 when he joined the Taliban,

00:02:02.577 --> 00:02:04.787
and he was killed before he turned 20.

00:02:05.705 --> 00:02:09.333
I asked both boys to imagine
themselves in ten years.

00:02:09.667 --> 00:02:11.919
Mohammad Asif said nothing and shrugged.

00:02:11.961 --> 00:02:13.629
I challenged him to try harder

00:02:13.671 --> 00:02:17.049
and see himself beyond
the soulless cells of the prison.

00:02:18.009 --> 00:02:19.302
It took several tries.

00:02:19.343 --> 00:02:21.179
He eventually responded,

00:02:21.220 --> 00:02:23.681
"I don't know, I'll probably be dead."

00:02:24.432 --> 00:02:27.435
On the same trip,
we visited Karsai Peak,

00:02:27.435 --> 00:02:29.896
which at the time was serving
as the frontline

00:02:29.937 --> 00:02:32.690
for Afghanistan's national army
fighting the Taliban.